WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:06.240
In reply to Father Emperor: your son does not know this Yu Gong. I only heard mention of this matter for the first time this very morning.

00:06.520 --> 00:13.500
Is that so? When a minister deceives his sovereign, he loses his head. When a son lies to his father, what then should be done?

00:14.960 --> 00:18.500
Here is the official memorial from the Imperial City Guard. Read it for yourself!

00:28.840 --> 00:35.000
Your son is wronged! I truly cannot fathom this memorial from the Imperial City Guard—I have never acted as anyone's patron!

00:35.360 --> 00:43.360
Wronged or not, you know the truth in your heart! Imprisoning your elder brother was enough to make your mother fall ill for days!
